---
description: Hugging Face LLM project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo builds a user-owned LLM on Hugging Face (fine-tune, then Hub).

When adding LLM code or notes:
- Do not start SFT/DPO/serving until configs/llm.json has goal, system_prompt, and hub_repo.
- Do not train from scratch unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not put official exam text, copyrighted books, or secrets in training data.
- Do not commit HF tokens, .env, checkpoints, or safetensors.
- Keep Korean explanations. Use the messages JSONL schema in src/llm/schema.py.
- Coding-test notes in docs/coding-test.md are study material, not a corpus.
